## Its importance:
 - Prevents large image size
 - Improvest build speed
 - Avoids leaking secrets (.env)
 - Shows professional practice

## Important clarity:
 -> .dockerignore controls what gets copied into the image during COPY . . 
 -> Without it, you accidentally copy everything.
